  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLARE - MET Office Climate Risk Reports</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to produce a set of up to 10 regional/country climate risk reports to provide internal FCDO programming staff with basic information about climate-related risk in their region/country. This takes an interdisciplinary approach to evaluating risk by assessing and interpreting the climate hazard over time, through the lens of the socio-economic conditions and vulnerability context.</narrative>
  </description>
